      "A": "Implement the safest parallel baseline: distribute independent target-body indices `i` across up to the target’s 4 CPU cores, using static scheduling. Preserve ascending `j` accumulation and the existing arithmetic; synchronize between force and position updates and between simulation iterations. Measure on all supplied cases and verify correctness before comparing speed.",
