      "analysis": "The only measurement is a valid baseline covering 4 cases, with mean runtime 0.660540 s (samples 0.660371–0.660841 s); there are no candidate results or prior interactions to guide selection. The provided source is an O(n²) force calculation repeated for 10 iterations. Its outer target-body loop is independent, making it a low-risk parallelization opportunity on the 4-core ARM64 target. Separate layout and target-lane SIMD experiments explore complementary CPU optimizations while preserving per-body accumulation order and the binary interface."
